    "title": "LE SSERAFIM and Overwatch Join Forces Again for \"Made My Night\" Collaboration - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jacob Aron Leung ,\n1 days ago Following the 2023 single “Perfect Night,” LE SSERAFIM partnered with the Overwatch video game series for the single album Made My Night on September 11, 2026. This pop-dance track suits late-night hangouts and gaming sessions with its energizing synth-driven, saxophone-centric chorus. “Made My Night” depicts a “night made special by a shared chemistry.” Whether that’s with a romantic partner or with the synergy of an in-game squad, it powers up evenings. With a more playful sound than its mellow predecessor, this catchy English track is sure to get stuck in the heads of K-Pop fans and gamers alike. Read full article",
